  <title>Quick commands</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>General</gui><gui>Quick command</gui></guiseq> lists every
  item of the main window's menus. It is quicker than hunting through the
  menus for a window you seldom use.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Type part of the menu item's name. The list shows only the items
    whose name contains what you typed, with the menu path to each in
    <gui>Path</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p>Double click an item, or select it and press <key>Enter</key>, to
    open it. The quick command window closes.</p></item>
  </steps>
  <p>Press <key>Esc</key> to close the window without opening anything.
  Menu items that are greyed out, such as the administrator windows before
  you log in, are not listed until PyGtk Posting is started again.</p>

</page>
